 spatial resolution soil property predictions (pH, organic carbon, clay/sand/silt content, bulk density).\',\n    status: \'LIVE_CONNECTED\',\n  },\n  {\n    id: \'DS_CROP_YIELD\',\n    name: \'Agricultural Crop Yield in Indian States Dataset (1997-2020)\',\n    provider: \'Ministry of Agriculture & Farmers Welfare / Kaggle Open Data\',\n    sourceUrl: \'https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/akshatgupta7/crop-yield-in-indian-states-dataset\',\n    retrievedAt: \'2026-08-09\',\n    license: \'Database Contents License (DbCL)\',\n    description: \'Historical crop yield dataset for training the XGBoost yield predictor with 12 features excluding Production to prevent target leakage.\',\n    status: \'VERIFIED_SNAPSHOT\',\n  },\n];\n"
