  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Backend Agents**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the initial architecture for the backend agents in `/src/backend/`. I\'ve begun outlining `nutrition_agent.ts`, which will calculate RDA targets using ICMR 2020 formulas and conduct nutrient gap analysis, including crop coverage metrics like `coverage = achieved / target * 100`. The next step is `crop_planning.ts`.\n\n\n**Designing ML Yield Regressor**\n\nMy current focus is the Gradient Boosted Decision Tree (GBDT) ML yield regressor within the `_agent.ts` file, and I\'m training it on `CROP_YIELD_TRAINING_RECORDS`. I\'m evaluating its performance using MAE, RMSE, and R2 on a 20% holdout test set with careful attention to prevent target leakage. I\'m also planning to incorporate a climate data agent that calls the Open-Meteo REST API for rule-based alerts.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 403813636
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
