r:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\342\230\201\357\270\217</span> Climate </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 hover:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\360\237\223\210</span> Market </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 hover:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\360\237\222\260</span> Finance </div> </nav> </div> <div class=\'mt-auto p-6 border-t border-[#D9D4C7]\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#D4A373]\'></div> <div> <p class=\'text-sm font-bold\'>Ramesh Kumar</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#6B6E6B]\'>Village: Malpura</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] text-[#6B6E6B] bg-[#F2EDE4] p-2 rounded\'> <span class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\'></span> Synced: 12 Oct, 09:42 (Local Cache) </div> </div> </aside> <main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col p-8 gap-6\'> <header class=\'flex justify-between items-end\'> <div> <h2 class=\'text-3xl font-serif italic text-[#4A6741]\'>Seasonal Decision Support</h2> <p class=\'text-[#6B6E6B] text-sm\'>Optimizing for Family Nutrition & Market Surplus</p> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4\'> <div class=\'text-right\'> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#6B6E6B] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold\'>Sustainability Score</p> <p class=\'text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-[#4A6741]\'>84/100</p> </div> </div> </header> <section class=\'grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 h-full\'> <div class=\'col-span-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\'> <div class=\'bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-[#EBE7DF]\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-4\'> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-[#6B6E6B]\'>Nutrition Coverage</h3> <span class=\'text-xs font-mono bg-[#F2F8F0] text-[#4A6741] px-2 py-1 rounded\'>Calculated</span> </div> <div class=\'space-y-4\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-1\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between text-