s=\'p-3 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-white/10\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] uppercase opacity-70\'>Family Diet</p> <p class=\'text-lg font-bold\'>25%</p> </div> <div class=\'p-3 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-white/10\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] uppercase opacity-70\'>Seed Reserve</p> <p class=\'text-lg font-bold\'>5%</p> </div> <div class=\'p-3 bg-white/10 rounded-xl border border-white/10\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] uppercase opacity-70\'>Storage</p> <p class=\'text-lg font-bold\'>5%</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'mt-6 p-4 bg-black/10 rounded-xl\'> <p class=\'text-xs font-bold mb-1 italic\'>\342\234\250 Optimization Logic (OR-Tools):</p> <p class=\'text-[11px] opacity-90 leading-tight\'>Allocation maximizes profit while meeting 100% of household caloric and micronutrient needs.</p> </div> </div> </section> <footer class=\'mt-auto flex justify-between items-center bg-[#EBE7DF]/40 p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#D9D4C7]\'> <div class=\'flex gap-6 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#8C8F8C] uppercase tracking-widest\'> <span>Provenances:</span> <span>Agmarknet v2.4</span> <span>ISRIC SoilGrids</span> <span>Open-Meteo API</span> <span>IFCT 2017</span> </div> <div class=\'text-[10px] text-[#4A6741] font-bold\'> NUTRIHARVEST AI v1.0.0-BETA </div> </footer> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Natural Tones\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Natural Tones\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'flex h-[768px] w-[1024px] overflow-hidden font-sans text-[#2D302D] bg-[#F9F7F2]\'> <aside class=\'w-64 bg-[#EBE7DF] border-r border-[#D9D4C7] flex flex-col\'> <div class=\'p-6\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 mb-8\'> <div class=\'w-8 h-8 bg-[#4A6741] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold\'>NH</div> <h1 class=\'text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#4A6741]\'>NutriHarvest AI</h1> </div> <nav class=\'space-y-1\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-[#D9D4C7] rounded-lg text-[#4A6741] font-semibold\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\342\212\236</span> Dashboard </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 hover:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\360\237\245\227</span> Nutrition </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 hover:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\360\237\214\276</span> Crop Plan </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 hover:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\342\230\201\357\270\217</span> Climate </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 hover:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\360\237\223\210</span> Market </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 p-3 hover:bg-[#D9D4C7]/50 rounded-lg transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-lg\'>\360\237\222\260</span> Finance </div> </nav> </div> <div class=\'mt-auto p-6 border-t border-[#D9D4C7]\'> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#D4A373]\'></div> <div> <p class=\'text-sm font-bold\'>Ramesh Kumar</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#6B6E6B]\'>Village: Malpura</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] text-[#6B6E6B] bg-[#F2EDE4] p-2 rounded\'> <span class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\'></span> Synced: 12 Oct, 09:42 (Local Cache) </div> </div> </aside> <main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col p-8 gap-6\'> <header class=\'flex justify-between items-end\'> <div> <h2 class=\'text-3xl font-serif italic text-[#4A6741]\'>Seasonal Decision Support</h2> <p class=\'text-[#6B6E6B] text-sm\'>Optimizing for Family Nutrition & Market Surplus</p> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4\'> <div class=\'text-right\'> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#6B6E6B] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold\'>Sustainability Score</p> <p class=\'text-2xl font-mono font-bold text-[#4A6741]\'>84/100</p> </div> </div> </header> <section class=\'grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 h-full\'> <div class=\'col-span-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6\'> <div class=\'bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-[#EBE7DF]\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-4\'> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-[#6B6E6B]\'>Nutrition Coverage</h3> <span class=\'text-xs font-mono bg-[#F2F8F0] text-[#4A6741] px-2 py-1 rounded\'>Calculated</span> </div> <div class=\'space-y-4\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-1\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between text-xs\'> <span>Protein</span> <span class=\'font-bold\'>92%</span> </div> <div class=\'w-full bg-[#F0EFEC] h-1.5 rounded-full\'> <div class=\'bg-[#4A6741] h-full rounded-full\' style=\'width: 92%\'></div> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-1\'> <div class=\'flex justify-between text-xs\'> <span>Iron (Fe)</span> <span class=\'font-bold text-red-500\'>64%</span> </div> <div class=\'w-full bg-[#F0EFEC] h-1.5 rounded-full\'> <div class=\'bg-[#D4A373] h-full rounded-full\' style=\'width: 64%\'></div> </div> </div> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-[#8C8F8C] italic mt-2\'>*Based on IFCT 2017 standards for 5-member household.</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-[#EBE7DF]\'> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-[#6B6E6B] mb-4\'>Climate Advisory</h3> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 mb-4\'> <div class=\'text-4xl\'>\360\237\214\247\357\270\217</div> <div> <p class=\'text-lg font-bold\'>Rain Alert</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#6B6E6B]\'>Moderate rainfall expected in 48h</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'bg-[#FDF9F3] border-l-4 border-[#D4A373] p-3\'> <p class=\'text-xs font-semibold text-[#8B5E34]\'>Irrigation Recommendation:</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#8B5E34]\'>Skip scheduled surface irrigation for Mustard crop.</p> </div> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-[#8C8F8C] mt-4 font-mono\'>SOURCE: Open-Meteo (Station: Malpura-04)</p> </div> <div class=\'bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-[#EBE7DF]\'> <h3 class=\'font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-[#6B6E6B] mb-4\'>Market Intelligence</h3> <div class=\'flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1\'> <span class=\'text-2xl font-mono font-bold\'>\342\202\2714,250</span> <span class=\'text-xs text-[#6B6E6B]\'>/Quintal</span> </div> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#4A6741] font-semibold mb-4\'>\342\206\221 4.2% Prophet Forecast (14 Days)</p> <div class=\'h-20 flex items-end gap-1\'> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#F0EFEC] h-[40%] rounded-t\'></div> <div class=\'flex-1 bg-[#F0EFEC] h-