  planner_response {
    response: "The **Natural Tones** design theme has been applied across the entire **NutriHarvest AI** application.\n\n### Key Aesthetic & Visual Updates\n\n- **Warm Natural Palette**:\n  - **Canvas & Card Layouts**: Structured using off-white and subtle warm stone containers (`#F9F7F2`, `#EBE7DF`, `#F2EDE4`) with refined 1px borders and balanced negative space.\n  - **Forest Green Accents**: Applied rich deep forest green (`#4A6741`, `#3A5033`) for primary CTA buttons, active state indicators, and key metric badges.\n  - **Terracotta & Earth Tones**: Implemented warm terracotta accents (`#D4A373`, `#8B5E34`) for financial summaries, market alerts, and storage optimization highlights.\n\n- **Typographic Hierarchy**:\n  - **Serif Headings**: Enhanced all major titles, section headers, and card headers with elegant *Instrument Serif* italic typography.\n  - **Body & Data**: Styled body text with *Plus Jakarta Sans* for high legibility, paired with *JetBrains Mono* for monetary values, crop yield statistics, and data codes.\n\n- **Component Coverage**:\n  - **Core Navigation & Banners**: `Navbar`, `DemoBanner`\n  - **Dashboards & Cards**: `ExecutiveDashboard`, `NutritionDashboard`, `CropPlanCard`, `ClimateWidget`, `MarketTrendsCard`\n  - **Wizards & Solvers**: `FarmerProfileWizard`, `HarvestAllocationOptimizer`\n  - **Modal Views & AI Assistant**: `AuthModal`, `DataSourcesModal`, `GeminiAssistant`"
    modified_response: "The **Natural Tones** design theme has been applied across the entire **NutriHarvest AI** application.\n\n### Key Aesthetic & Visual Updates\n\n- **Warm Natural Palette**:\n  - **Canvas & Card Layouts**: Structured using off-white and subtle warm stone containers (`#F9F7F2`, `#EBE7DF`, `#F2EDE4`) with refined 1px borders and balanced negative space.\n  - **Forest Green Accents**: Applied rich deep forest green (`#4A6741`, `#3A5033`) for primary CTA buttons, active state indicators, and key metric badges.\n  - **Terracotta & Earth Tones**: Implemented warm terracotta accents (`#D4A373`, `#8B5E34`) for financial summaries, market alerts, and storage optimization highlights.\n\n- **Typographic Hierarchy**:\n  - **Serif Headings**: Enhanced all major titles, section headers, and card headers with elegant *Instrument Serif* italic typography.\n  - **Body & Data**: Styled body text with *Plus Jakarta Sans* for high legibility, paired with *JetBrains Mono* for monetary values, crop yield statistics, and data codes.\n\n- **Component Coverage**:\n  - **Core Navigation & Banners**: `Navbar`, `DemoBanner`\n  - **Dashboards & Cards**: `ExecutiveDashboard`, `NutritionDashboard`, `CropPlanCard`, `ClimateWidget`, `MarketTrendsCard`\n  - **Wizards & Solvers**: `FarmerProfileWizard`, `HarvestAllocationOptimizer`\n  - **Modal Views & AI Assistant**: `AuthModal`, `DataSourcesModal`, `GeminiAssistant`"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
