    user_response: "Implement user authentication using Supabase Auth. This includes creating sign-up, login, and logout functionalities. Ensure session persistence across application restarts and implement protected routes to secure user-specific data. Handle authentication state changes appropriately and integrate with the Supabase database for user profiles. Ensure all Supabase credentials are managed securely using environment variables.\n\nCreate a guided onboarding flow for new users. This flow should collect essential information such as household size, age groups, dietary preferences, farm size, location, water availability, soil information, budget, and crop history. Ensure the flow is intuitive and collects all necessary data for personalized recommendations. Implement proper input validation and error handling. Store this initial data in the Supabase database.\n\n\nIntegrate the Open-Meteo API to fetch real-time weather data including temperature, precipitation, humidity, and wind. Implement the WeatherProvider interface to handle data retrieval and cache results. Display this data in the application and use it to power climate alerts and irrigation recommendations."
