  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Current Structures**\n\nI\'ve noted that `FarmProfile` includes `cropHistory` (a `string[]`). Also, `HouseholdProfile` contains essential details like `householdSize`, `ageGroups`, and `dietPreference`. Finally, `FarmProfile` is rich with `landAreaAcres`, location data, `waterSource`, `soil`, and budget specifics. I\'m focusing on the interplay between these profiles now.\n\n\n**Implementing Weather Provider**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `WeatherProvider` interface to integrate Open-Meteo API. I\'ve defined the interface with `getWeatherForecast` and `clearCache` methods. An `OpenMeteoWeatherProvider` class is taking shape, featuring caching with a configurable TTL, and data fetching from the Open-Meteo API. I\'m focusing on ensuring it handles data retrieval and caching efficiently.\n\n\n**Integrating Weather Data**\n\nI\'m now integrating the Open-Meteo API data. I\'m focusing on extracting key metrics: temperature, precipitation, humidity, wind, and evapotranspiration. My goal is to build climate alerts and irrigation recommendations using ET0 and precipitation probability. I\'m also planning a fallback cache for offline use or retrieval failures.\n\nI\'m also working on Supabase authentication, implementing `signUp`, `signIn`, `signOut`, and session management to persist user sessions and integrate user/farm profiles from the database. There\'s a graceful fallback to localStorage.\n\n\n**Designing User Authentication**\n\nI\'m making progress on authentication: Supabase integration using `signUp`, `signIn`, and `signOut` for session management is underway, with localStorage as a fallback. I\'m focusing on environment variables for secure API key management and securing protected routes based on user login status.\n\\n\\n\nI\'m ensuring authenticated users see their profile data, sync status, and have access to protected save/sync actions. Unauthenticated users will have view access, with an option to sign up.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 222506819
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
