    thinking: "**Constructing the Onboarding Wizard**\n\nI\'m now diving into building the multi-step onboarding wizard in `/src/components/FarmerProfileWizard.tsx`. I\'m meticulously verifying the data the user requests during onboarding, specifically focusing on household size and age groups like 0-5, 6-12, 13-18, and 19-5.\n\n\n**Expanding the Wizard\'s Scope**\n\nI\'m expanding the wizard\'s data collection. I\'m adding dietary preferences, farm size, location details (State, District), and water availability options (Irrigated Borewell, etc.). I\'m also including soil information (type, pH, N, P, K, OC), seasonal budget, and crop history (multi-select). I\'m visualizing the steps with intuitive progress indicators. I\'m prioritizing input validation and error handling for a smoother experience, and storing it in Supabase. I will look for suitable lucide-react icons.\n\n\n"
