vailability offline.\n  - **Rule-Based Climate Engine**: Automated actionable irrigation schedules (e.g., pausing canal pumps during 60%+ rain forecasts) and heat alerts, wired directly into `ClimateAgent` and the `ExecutiveDashboard`."
