    thinking: "**Analyzing User Requests**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the specifics of the user\'s request. My focus is currently on the initial experience: the intro or landing page. I\'m breaking down what\'s needed for an unauthenticated user, and the details associated. I\'m considering what information should be presented and the best way to accomplish it.\n\n\n**Defining Landing Page Elements**\n\nI\'ve decided to prioritize the initial user experience. I\'m focusing on the unauthenticated user and have decided to prominently feature the app\'s logo and a concise explanation of its purpose and benefits. I\'m finalizing the placement of the \"Get Started\" and \"Log In\" buttons, while also developing the UI, which will be modern and professional, matching the Natural Tones theme, and using a clean typography and icons. I\'ve ruled out showing any protected content. I\'m now developing the authentication flows: the Get Started button, the Sign Up / Login screen.\n\n\n**Mapping User Journeys**\n\nI\'m now detailing the user flow within the main app, concentrating on onboarding. The plan is to collect key information: household details, dietary data, farm characteristics, location, resources, crop history, and budget. This data will be securely saved in the Supabase database. I\'ll flag the profile as \"onboarding completed.\" I\'m also ensuring the flow is enforced: from landing to app features. I\'m focusing on a smooth experience during session restoration, including authentication checks, profile status verification, and avoiding any flash of the dashboard.\n\n\n**Implementing Access Control**\n\nI\'m now detailing access control rules. I\'ve defined conditions for displaying each page: the onboarding page, the intro/landing page, and the dashboard. I\'ve designed a system of redirections to guarantee restricted data accessibility. I\'m focusing on user journeys: redirecting unauthenticated users to the intro page when they try accessing protected areas, or onboarding users to the onboarding page. The sign-out flow now redirects to the intro page. I\'m ensuring returning users with completed profiles are routed immediately to the dashboard.\n\n\n"
