  planner_response {
    response: "I have updated NutriHarvest AI to follow a **standard modern app onboarding and authentication flow**:\n\n### Key Features Implemented\n\n1. **Intro / Landing Page (`LandingPage.tsx`)**:\n   - **Hero & Branding**: Prominent logo, serif typography, and clear value proposition highlighting ICMR IFCT 2017 household nutrition security, Open-Meteo climate advisories, AGMARKNET price forecasting, and OR-Tools harvest allocation.\n   - **Primary CTAs**: \"Get Started\" (Sign Up) and \"Log In\" buttons.\n   - **Feature Showcase & Trust Badges**: Displays core platform modules and verified data source credentials.\n   - **Strict Protection**: Protects all main app features from unauthenticated access.\n\n2. **Supabase Authentication**:\n   - **Sign Up / Log In / Sign Out**: Integrated directly with `SupabaseService` (`src/backend/supabase_service.ts`) using Supabase Auth with Row Level Security (RLS).\n   - **Session Restoration**: Restores user sessions across restarts/refreshes automatically via `SupabaseService.getSession()` and `onAuthStateChange`.\n\n3. **Mandatory Guided Onboarding Flow (`FarmerProfileWizard.tsx`)**:\n   - Collects required information: household size, age group breakdown (0\342\200\2235, 6\342\200\22312, 13\342\200\22318, 19\342\200\22359, 60+ yrs), dietary preferences (Vegetarian, Eggetarian, Non-Veg, Vegan), farm land area, location (State, District), water sources, soil properties (type, pH, Nitrogen, Phosphorus), budget (\342\202\271), and crop history.\n   - **Supabase Persistence**: Stores onboarding data securely in Supabase database tables (`farmer_onboarding` and `profiles`) associated with the user\'s ID.\n\n4. **Enforced App Sequence**:\n   - **First-time User**: Intro Page \342\206\222 Sign Up \342\206\222 Mandatory Onboarding Form \342\206\222 Main Dashboard & App Features.\n   - **Returning User (Profile Completed)**: Auto-detected Session / Login \342\206\222 Main Dashboard.\n   - **User with Incomplete Onboarding**: Login \342\206\222 Mandatory Onboarding Form \342\206\222 Main Dashboard.\n\n5. **Application-Level Route Protection**:\n   - **Loading Shield**: Added an initial `isCheckingAuth` loading state to eliminate flash of protected content during startup.\n   - **Unauthenticated Redirect**: Unauthenticated users see only the Landing Page and Auth Modal.\n   - **Incomplete Onboarding Shield**: Authenticated users who have not finished onboarding are restricted to the Onboarding Form with an explanatory alert banner until submitted."
    thinking: "**Verifying Initial Steps**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the `compile_applet` success. Now, I\'m verifying the initial sequence requirements. The landing page, or `LandingPage`, seems to be rendering correctly for unauthenticated users, displaying the logo \"NutriHarvest AI\", features, benefits, and trust badges, as expected. I\'m moving on to the subsequent sequence steps.\n\n\n**Defining User Journeys**\n\nI\'m now focusing on user journeys. I\'m looking at how the \"Get Started\" and \"Log In\" buttons work with the authentication flow, and how they ensure protected features remain hidden until authorization is complete. I\'m fleshing out the sign-up, log-in, and log-out processes that use `SupabaseService` for session persistence. I\'m also ensuring the correct flow happens for new users versus existing users who may or may not have completed their onboarding.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have updated NutriHarvest AI to follow a **standard modern app onboarding and authentication flow**:\n\n### Key Features Implemented\n\n1. **Intro / Landing Page (`LandingPage.tsx`)**:\n   - **Hero & Branding**: Prominent logo, serif typography, and clear value proposition highlighting ICMR IFCT 2017 household nutrition security, Open-Meteo climate advisories, AGMARKNET price forecasting, and OR-Tools harvest allocation.\n   - **Primary CTAs**: \"Get Started\" (Sign Up) and \"Log In\" buttons.\n   - **Feature Showcase & Trust Badges**: Displays core platform modules and verified data source credentials.\n   - **Strict Protection**: Protects all main app features from unauthenticated access.\n\n2. **Supabase Authentication**:\n   - **Sign Up / Log In / Sign Out**: Integrated directly with `SupabaseService` (`src/backend/supabase_service.ts`) using Supabase Auth with Row Level Security (RLS).\n   - **Session Restoration**: Restores user sessions across restarts/refreshes automatically via `SupabaseService.getSession()` and `onAuthStateChange`.\n\n3. **Mandatory Guided Onboarding Flow (`FarmerProfileWizard.tsx`)**:\n   - Collects required information: household size, age group breakdown (0\342\200\2235, 6\342\200\22312, 13\342\200\22318, 19\342\200\22359, 60+ yrs), dietary preferences (Vegetarian, Eggetarian, Non-Veg, Vegan), farm land area, location (State, District), water sources, soil properties (type, pH, Nitrogen, Phosphorus), budget (\342\202\271), and crop history.\n   - **Supabase Persistence**: Stores onboarding data securely in Supabase database tables (`farmer_onboarding` and `profiles`) associated with the user\'s ID.\n\n4. **Enforced App Sequence**:\n   - **First-time User**: Intro Page \342\206\222 Sign Up \342\206\222 Mandatory Onboarding Form \342\206\222 Main Dashboard & App Features.\n   - **Returning User (Profile Completed)**: Auto-detected Session / Login \342\206\222 Main Dashboard.\n   - **User with Incomplete Onboarding**: Login \342\206\222 Mandatory Onboarding Form \342\206\222 Main Dashboard.\n\n5. **Application-Level Route Protection**:\n   - **Loading Shield**: Added an initial `isCheckingAuth` loading state to eliminate flash of protected content during startup.\n   - **Unauthenticated Redirect**: Unauthenticated users see only the Landing Page and Auth Modal.\n   - **Incomplete Onboarding Shield**: Authenticated users who have not finished onboarding are restricted to the Onboarding Form with an explanatory alert banner until submitted."
