mer.farmerName}</p>\n              <p><strong>Household Size:</strong> {farmer.householdSize} members</p>\n              <p><strong>Dietary Choice:</strong> {farmer.dietPreference}</p>\n              <p>\n                <strong>Age Groups:</strong> {farmer.ageGroups.children0_5} Children (0-5), {farmer.ageGroups.children6_12} Children (6-12), {farmer.ageGroups.teens13_18} Teens, {farmer.ageGroups.adults19_59} Adults, {farmer.ageGroups.seniors60Plus} Seniors\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"bg-[#F9F7F2] p-4 rounded-xl border border-[#EBE7DF] space-y-2 text-xs\">\n              <span className=\"font-bold text-[#4A6741] uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] block\">\n                2. Farm & Soil Profile\n              </span>\n              <p><strong>Location:</strong> {farm.district}, {farm.state}</p>\n              <p><strong>Land Size:</strong> {farm.landAreaAcres} Acres</p>\n              <p><strong>Water Supply:</strong> {farm.waterSource}</p>\n              <p><strong>Budget:</strong> \342\202\271{farm.budgetInr.toLocaleString(\'en-IN\')}</p>\n              <p><strong>Soil:</strong> {farm.soil.type} (pH {farm.soil.pH})</p>\n              <p><strong>Crop History:</strong> {farm.cropHistory.join(\', \') || \'None selected\'}</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>"
