ed test cases. I\'ve confirmed error messages appear correctly when a user tries to log in with an incorrect password, and that the authentication modal stays open, as expected. I\'m also confirming behavior when a non-existent email address is entered, ensuring an appropriate error message is displayed, and access to protected routes is blocked. I\'m also focused on validating the logout flow, ensuring the user is properly signed out, and redirected to the landing page with the session properly cleared, preventing further access to the dashboard.\n\n\n**Validating the Refresh**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in validating the session refresh and existing user flows. For test case 6, I\'ve confirmed that a logged-in user refreshing the browser correctly restores the session, retrieves the user\'s profile, and navigates back to the dashboard, which also updates farmer, farm, and `hasCompletedOnboarding` data. For test case 7, I\'ve confirmed that when an existing user with an incomplete profile logs in, they are correctly directed to the onboarding wizard, with pre-filled fields, and that completing onboarding properly saves the updated data and redirects to the dashboard.\n\n\n"
