  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Yield Data**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `YieldTrackingAgent`. This component will handle user-entered yield data post-harvest. I plan to use local storage and Supabase to store this information per user. The key next step involves computing prediction errors based on this data. I\'m thinking about the most efficient way to structure the data for error calculation.\n\n\n**Developing Farm Progress**\n\nI\'ve been working on the `FarmProgressTracker`. My current focus is on building a daily timeline to capture farm events. I am working on capturing Sowing, Irrigation, Fertilizer application, Pest observation, Growth Stage changes, and Harvest updates. I intend to build a visualization of data provenance with badges. I am working to make this interactive and chronological for active crops.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Nutritional Needs**\n\nI\'m now diving into the household nutrition gaps, considering budget constraints and crop rotation. I\'m building out a `NutritionDashboard.tsx` with four distinct stages: requirements, current production, gaps, and recommendations. Data source badges will clearly indicate provenance. Next, I plan to integrate the `ClimateWidget.tsx` using the Open-Meteo REST API for live weather data, with a clear fallback if the API is unavailable, including irrigation recommendations.\n\n\n"
