teWidget`)**:\n  - Added FAO-56 Penman-Monteith reference evapotranspiration ($ET_0$) calculations with practical volumetric water requirements (~Liters/acre) and crop coefficients ($K_c$). Includes explicit notes indicating calculated atmospheric estimates versus hardware sensors."
