 and then calculate total nutrients produced by multiplying the crop yield by IFCT 2017 nutrient values. I\'m focusing on protein, calories, iron, calcium, Vitamin A, Vitamin C, and fiber. Finally, I will compare these values to the Household Monthly RDA, and generate coverage percentages.\n\n\n"
