    thinking: "**Reviewing Deletion Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on implementing `deleteLogEntry` and `deleteYieldRecord` methods within `FarmProgressService` and `YieldTrackingAgent`. Right now, I\'m thinking about how deletion should work in both. I have started working through the implementation of `FarmProgressService`.\n\n\n**Implementing Data Deletion**\n\nI\'ve just implemented the deletion logic for both daily logs and yield records. I\'m using `filter` to create an updated array excluding the entry to be deleted, then overwriting the local storage. I\'ve also integrated the necessary \"Delete\" button and confirmation prompts into the UI components.\n\n\n**Analyzing Nutrient Coverage**\n\nI\'m now diving into how the Nutrition Calculation requirement and the Actual vs. Predicted Yield requirement are connected across the application components. I am planning to review the interaction between components in detail, from App.tsx, to NutritionDashboard.tsx, and ExecutiveDashboard.tsx, to ensure data flow and correct calculations. The goal is to verify that calculations reflect what the farmer is actually growing, and to ensure each component accurately visualizes nutrient coverage based on actual yields.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 562454246
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
