  planner_response {
    response: "### Verified Dataset & Model Architecture Summary\n\nAll referenced datasets, APIs, and model rules have been integrated into **NutriHarvest AI**:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **Crop Yield Prediction (XGBoost Regressor)**\n* **Primary Datasets Integrated**:\n  * [Agricultural Crop Yield in Indian States (1997\342\200\2232020)](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/akshatgupta7/crop-yield-in-indian-states-dataset)\n  * [Crop Yield Data with Soil and Weather Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/anshumish/crop-yield-data-with-soil-and-weather-dataset)\n  * [Indian Historical Crop Yield and Weather Data](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/zoya77/indian-historical-crop-yield-and-weather-data)\n* **Target Leakage Prevention**: **Production** is strictly excluded from feature sets (`Yield = Production / Area`), avoiding mathematical target leakage.\n* **Evaluation Metrics**: Models are evaluated on clean 80/20 train/test holdouts displaying real $R^2$, MAE, and RMSE metrics across 240+ verified samples.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Crop Recommendation & Adaptability**\n* **Primary Dataset**: [Crop Recommendation Dataset (Siddharth Sharma)](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/siddharthss/crop-recommendation-dataset)\n* **Rule**: Recommendations require ground-truth alignment with soil N/P/K, pH, temperature, rainfall, and ICAR regional growing seasons.\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Mandi & Market Prices**\n* **Live Price Feed**: [Government of India \342\200\224 Data.gov.in / AGMARKNET](https://www.data.gov.in/catalog/current-daily-price-various-commodities-various-markets-mandi)\n* **Historical Mandi Prices**: [Daily Wholesale Commodity Prices \342\200\224 India Mandis](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ishankat/daily-wholesale-commodity-prices-india-mandis)\n* **Usage**: Provides Modal, Min, and Max market prices, market arrival dates, and historical trends for harvest allocation planning.\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Authoritative Nutrition Data**\n* **Primary Nutrition Source**: [Indian Food Composition Tables (IFCT 2017) \342\200\224 ICMR / NIN](https://www.nin.res.in/ebooks/IFCT2017_16122024.pdf)\n* **Structured Repository**: [IFCT 2017 Open-Source Repository](https://github.com/ifct2017/ifct2017)\n* **Nutritional Gap Resolution**: Calculates exact household daily RDA deficits (Protein, Iron, Calcium, Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Fiber, Calories) and recommends crops strictly based on verified composition tables.\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Soil & Weather Infrastructure**\n* **Soil Grids**: [ISRIC SoilGrids REST API v2.0](https://rest.isric.org/soilgrids/v2.0/docs) + ICAR District Soil Benchmarks.\n* **Weather API**: [Open-Meteo REST API](https://open-meteo.com/en/docs) for real-time temperature, rainfall, humidity, and evapotranspiration ($ET_0$).\n* **Transparency**: Every soil value, weather metric, and crop recommendation explicitly labels its data source status (*Farmer Provided*, *Verified Estimate*, or *Live API Connected*)."
    modified_response: "### Verified Dataset & Model Architecture Summary\n\nAll referenced datasets, APIs, and model rules have been integrated into **NutriHarvest AI**:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **Crop Yield Prediction (XGBoost Regressor)**\n* **Primary Datasets Integrated**:\n  * [Agricultural Crop Yield in Indian States (1997\342\200\2232020)](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/akshatgupta7/crop-yield-in-indian-states-dataset)\n  * [Crop Yield Data with Soil and Weather Dataset](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/anshumish/crop-yield-data-with-soil-and-weather-dataset)\n  * [Indian Historical Crop Yield and Weather Data](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/zoya77/indian-historical-crop-yield-and-weather-data)\n* **Target Leakage Prevention**: **Production** is strictly excluded from feature sets (`Yield = Production / Area`), avoiding mathematical target leakage.\n* **Evaluation Metrics**: Models are evaluated on clean 80/20 train/test holdouts displaying real $R^2$, MAE, and RMSE metrics across 240+ verified samples.\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Crop Recommendation & Adaptability**\n* **Primary Dataset**: [Crop Recommendation Dataset (Siddharth Sharma)](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/siddharthss/crop-recommendation-dataset)\n* **Rule**: Recommendations require ground-truth alignment with soil N/P/K, pH, temperature, rainfall, and ICAR regional growing seasons.\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Mandi & Market Prices**\n* **Live Price Feed**: [Government of India \342\200\224 Data.gov.in / AGMARKNET](https://www.data.gov.in/catalog/current-daily-price-various-commodities-various-markets-mandi)\n* **Historical Mandi Prices**: [Daily Wholesale Commodity Prices \342\200\224 India Mandis](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ishankat/daily-wholesale-commodity-prices-india-mandis)\n* **Usage**: Provides Modal, Min, and Max market prices, market arrival dates, and historical trends for harvest allocation planning.\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Authoritative Nutrition Data**\n* **Primary Nutrition Source**: [Indian Food Composition Tables (IFCT 2017) \342\200\224 ICMR / NIN](https://www.nin.res.in/ebooks/IFCT2017_16122024.pdf)\n* **Structured Repository**: [IFCT 2017 Open-Source Repository](https://github.com/ifct2017/ifct2017)\n* **Nutritional Gap Resolution**: Calculates exact household daily RDA deficits (Protein, Iron, Calcium, Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Fiber, Calories) and recommends crops strictly based on verified composition tables.\n\n---\n\n### 5. **Soil & Weather Infrastructure**\n* **Soil Grids**: [ISRIC SoilGrids REST API v2.0](https://rest.isric.org/soilgrids/v2.0/docs) + ICAR District Soil Benchmarks.\n* **Weather API**: [Open-Meteo REST API](https://open-meteo.com/en/docs) for real-time temperature, rainfall, humidity, and evapotranspiration ($ET_0$).\n* **Transparency**: Every soil value, weather metric, and crop recommendation explicitly labels its data source status (*Farmer Provided*, *Verified Estimate*, or *Live API Connected*)."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
