feguard |\n| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |\n| `State_Name` | Farmer Profile | **Yes** | **Yes** | **No Risk** (Location parameter) |\n| `District_Name` | Farmer Profile | **Yes** | **Yes** | **No Risk** (Agro-climatic zone) |\n| `Crop` | Farmer Choice | **Yes** | **Yes** | **No Risk** (Target category) |\n| `Season` | Planting Time | **Yes** | **Yes** | **No Risk** (Kharif/Rabi/Zaid) |\n| `Area_ha` | Farmer Profile | **Yes** | **Yes** | **Checked**: Area is an input variable. Models evaluated with & without Area to verify no proxy leakage. |\n| `Soil_pH` | SoilGrids API / Soil Test | **Yes** | **Yes** | **No Risk** (Physical soil property) |\n| `Soil_N` | SoilGrids API / Soil Test | **Yes** | **Yes** | **No Risk** (Total nitrogen content) |\n| `Soil_P` | Soil Test / Missing | **If Test Provided** | **If Test Provided** | **No Risk**: Never fabricated. Left as missing if no test provided. |\n| `Soil_K` | Soil Test / Missing | **If Test Provided** | **If Test Provided** | **No Risk**: Never fabricated. Left as missing if no test provided. |\n| `Rainfall_mm` | Historical Avg / Open-Meteo | **Yes (Historical Avg)** | **Yes (Actual-to-Date)** | **Prevented**: Pre-season uses historical climate mean. In-season uses actual Open-Meteo API data. |\n| `Fertilizer_kg_ha` | Farmer Planned / Applied | **Yes (Planned)** | **Yes (Actual Applied)** | **Prevented**: Pre-season uses farmer\'s planned budget rate. In-season uses actual log. |\n| `Pesticide_kg_ha` | Farmer Planned / Applied | **Yes (Planned)** | **Yes (Actual Applied)** | **Prevented**: Pre-season uses planned application rate. In-season uses actual log. |\n| `Production` | Harvest Report | **NO** | **NO** | **REMOVED (CRITICAL LEAKAGE)**: $Yield = \\frac{Production}{Area}$. Completely excluded. |\n\n---\n\n**Confirmation Request:** The feature availability, pre-season vs in-season distinction, SoilGrids limitation, and temporal validation splits are audited and ready. Please confirm to proceed with implementing