del metric object updated to store the dataset name, training/test periods, and sample counts.\n\n\n**Tracking Yield Feedback**\n\nMy focus has shifted to incorporating actual yield feedback. I\'m updating `YieldTrackingModal.tsx` and `farm_progress_service.ts` to log predicted and actual yields, alongside relevant metadata like crop, district, and season. This includes calculating prediction error. This data will be tracked without automatically retraining, using it to replace any synthetic data in `src/data/crop_yield_dataset.ts` with a real dataset from the Ministry of Agriculture. I\'m checking the feasibility of storing an extensive dataset extracted from the official Ministry of Agriculture / Kaggle Crop Yield dataset spanning 1997\342\200\2232020.\n\n\n"
